{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55447","headline":"拟寒山 四 · 泰钦","name":"拟寒山 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"闲步游南陌，唯便野兴多。\n傍花看蝶舞，近柳听莺歌。\n稚子捞溪莱，山翁携蕨萝。\n问渠何处住，回首指前坡。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"泰钦","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_55447.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_55447","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}